SeaArt is designed to make AI creation accessible to beginners while giving experienced creators room to build more advanced workflows. Its rich, feature-packed interface brings image generation, video generation, editing, model discovery, model training, LoRA customization, and multi-model workflows into one web workspace. Users can start with ready-to-use tools and gradually explore more controlled creative workflows directly in the browser.

