## Frequently Asked Questions

**Q: What is SeaArt AI?**  
A: SeaArt AI is an all-in-one AI creative platform for generating and editing images, creating videos, discovering and using AI models, training custom LoRAs, using AI apps and workflows, and publishing creations in a creator community.

**Q: Is SeaArt AI free to use?**  
A: Yes. SeaArt offers free access to selected features and provides daily Stamina for eligible image and video creation. Users who need more credits, higher limits, or additional benefits can choose a paid plan or purchase coins.

**Q: Is SeaArt AI only an AI image generator?**  
A: No. SeaArt supports AI image generation, AI video generation, image editing, image upscaling, AI chat, model discovery, LoRA training, AI apps, workflows, and community creation.

**Q: What types of content can I create with SeaArt AI?**  
A: SeaArt supports the creation of AI images, AI videos, product visuals, advertisements, character designs, illustrations, cinematic scenes, social media content, concept art, and other visual assets.

**Q: What inputs can I use with SeaArt AI?**  
A: Depending on the selected model or tool, users can create content from text prompts, reference images, video clips, audio files, and existing creations.

**Q: What AI models are available on SeaArt?**  
A: SeaArt provides a searchable library of image, video, audio, and multimodal AI models, including official models and community-created models. Model availability, supported inputs, generation costs, and capabilities vary by model.

**Q: Can I edit, remove backgrounds, or upscale images on SeaArt AI?**  
A: Yes. SeaArt provides AI image editing, background removal, object removal, image enhancement, and image upscaling tools.

**Q: Does SeaArt AI support AI apps and creative workflows?**  
A: Yes. SeaArt provides AI apps and workflows for image generation, video creation, image editing, model use, content enhancement, and other specialized creative tasks.

**Q: Can I train and run custom models on SeaArt online?**  
A: Yes. SeaArt provides browser-based LoRA training for supported image and video workflows. Creators can train custom LoRAs from their own character, product, face, or style images, then preview, publish, share, and reuse them in compatible generation workflows.

**Q: Does SeaArt AI support personalized characters, products, and styles?**  
A: Yes. Users can use reference images, custom models, and LoRAs to create more consistent characters, products, faces, subjects, and visual styles.

**Q: Can I publish models, apps, or workflows on SeaArt AI?**  
A: Yes. Creators can publish and share eligible models, LoRAs, AI apps, workflows, prompts, and generated works with the SeaArt community.

**Q: Does SeaArt AI support ComfyUI workflows?**  
A: Yes. SeaArt provides ComfyUI-related workflows that allow users to create, run, customize, and share node-based AI pipelines online.

**Q: Does SeaArt AI have a public community or gallery?**  
A: Yes. SeaArt includes a creator community where users can discover, publish, and share AI-generated works, prompts, models, workflows, and creative ideas. Reuse of community content is subject to the creator's permissions and applicable platform rules.

**Q: Can I keep my SeaArt creations private?**  
A: Yes. Creators can choose whether to keep their creations private or share them publicly. Before publishing, review the visibility settings and ensure that you have the necessary rights to uploaded or referenced content.

**Q: Can SeaArt AI be used for commercial content?**  
A: Yes. SeaArt can be used to create product visuals, advertisements, social media content, concept art, and other marketing materials. Before commercial use, confirm that you have the necessary rights to your inputs, selected models, generated outputs, and third-party elements.

**Q: Is SeaArt AI suitable for beginners and professional creators?**  
A: Yes. Beginners can start with ready-to-use AI tools, models, apps, and prompts, while experienced creators can use model customization, LoRA training, workflows, and advanced generation controls.

**Q: Can I use SeaArt AI without installing software?**  
A: Yes. SeaArt is a browser-based AI creation platform. Users can access its main creative features online without installing local AI models or requiring high-end hardware.

**Q: Can I use SeaArt AI on mobile?**  
A: Yes. SeaArt can be accessed through desktop browsers, mobile browsers, and supported SeaArt applications using the same account. Available features may vary depending on the device, region, account, and selected tool.

**Q: Does SeaArt AI provide tutorials for beginners?**  
A: Yes. Users can learn through SeaArt tutorials, the Creator Academy, the SeaArt Guide, blog articles, prompt guides, and community-shared creative examples. These resources cover image generation, video generation, prompting, model selection, LoRA training, workflows, and advanced creative techniques.

